WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.769
-Dave and I have a -- We have a
lot of history together.

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.237
-We do.

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:07.073
-Not a lot of people know this,
but back in the early '90s,

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:10.643
we used to sing commercial
jingles for different products.

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:13.412
And we had fun.
It was a pretty weird job.

00:00:13.412 --> 00:00:14.580
-It was weird.
-It was, yeah.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.248
-What do you mean?
Because of the director?

00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:18.417
-Yeah, well,
our director wanted to keep

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:21.053
our performances fresh,
so he wouldn't let us see

00:00:21.053 --> 00:00:22.989
the lines
until we were shooting.

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:26.125
We were singing them for the
first time right there on set.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.393
-It was weird.

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:29.228
-Well, I found some of
our old videos,

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:31.397
so here, for the
first time in decades,

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:34.033
are me and Dave's
original commercial jingles.

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:36.069
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:48.648
♪♪

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:50.683
-♪ Ruffles potato chips ♪

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.451
♪ They're like corduroy pants ♪

00:00:52.451 --> 00:00:55.055
♪ That you put in your mouth ♪

00:00:57.457 --> 00:01:02.362
♪♪

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:03.629
-♪ Hensherson's Floors ♪

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:04.997
♪ Hensherson's Floors ♪

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:07.600
♪ Where would we
be without floors? ♪

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:10.937
♪ The correct answer is hell ♪

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:17.176
♪♪

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:20.613
-♪ Yellow sandwich paste ♪

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:23.383
♪ I don't care for mustard ♪

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:26.519
♪ But maybe you will ♪

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:28.788
♪ I just don't really
give a damn ♪

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:29.889
♪ Just kidding ♪

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:34.060
♪ I love
French's mustard...not ♪

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:39.599
♪♪

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:43.503
-♪ Sidetown Discount
Carpet Stores ♪

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:46.972
♪ All the stains
are food stains ♪

00:01:46.972 --> 00:01:52.411
♪ We swear no murders were
committed on these carpets ♪

00:01:52.411 --> 00:01:56.048
♪ Oh, no, wait,
there was one murder ♪

00:01:56.048 --> 00:01:59.152
♪ But it was an accident ♪

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.788
R.I.P., Todd McDaniels.

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:08.561
♪♪

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:11.197
-♪ When I say "Franken,"
you say "Stein" ♪

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:12.331
-♪ Franken ♪
-♪ Stein ♪

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:13.599
-♪ Franken ♪
-♪ Stein ♪

00:02:13.599 --> 00:02:14.833
-♪ Frunken ♪
-♪ Stein ♪

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:17.236
♪ I didn't say "Franken,"
I said "Frunken " ♪

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:18.471
♪ I win, you lose ♪

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:20.607
♪ Buy Barry's Bananas ♪

00:02:22.608 --> 00:02:26.212
♪♪

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:29.782
-♪ Welcome to the
realm of nightmares ♪

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:34.653
♪ Jackals laugh
as you fight to escape ♪

00:02:34.653 --> 00:02:36.322
♪ The fires are rising ♪

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:38.157
♪ You try to scream ♪

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:39.859
♪ But all that comes out

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:43.396
is "Lipton's peppermint tea" ♪

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:53.640
♪♪

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.008
-♪ Ooh ♪

00:02:59.578 --> 00:03:01.314
-♪ Ooh, bendy, bendy ♪

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:03.048
-♪ Ooh, pointy, pointy ♪

00:03:03.048 --> 00:03:04.783
-♪ Arm go bendy ♪

00:03:04.783 --> 00:03:06.485
-♪ Arm get pointy ♪

00:03:06.485 --> 00:03:09.856
-♪ Elbows number one ♪

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:13.292
♪ Elbows number one ♪

00:03:13.292 --> 00:03:14.960
♪ Elbows good ♪

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.629
♪ Elbows fun ♪

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:20.700
♪ Elbow high fives ♪

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.735
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:03:26.038 --> 00:03:27.273
-Can you believe
they found those --

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:28.341
they found those old videos?

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:30.910
-Unbelievable.
-My thanks to Dave Grohl.

